753,/LibyanBedouin_AbuLughod_1986_227_KS,NorthernAfrica,LibyanBedouin,co-wives,kin_role,Safiyya,person,kinship,Recurring patterned teasing by co-wives of a wife's immodest expressions (kin-based joking).,"She had recited the other poem in the presence of a number of women, including her co-wives, who said nothing. When I asked her what the poem meant, one co-wife joked, “Go ask ‘the man’ when he comes home.”",joked,,non_symmetric,teasing,0.7,,2026-07-06T09:31:06.823549+00:00
