1173,/san_marshall_206_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,nephews,kin_role,kinship,Text lists nephews as ones ego avoids joking with; institutional kinship avoidance.,"Ego avoids joking with his uncles, aunts, nephews, and nieces, who are, respectively, of his parents' and his offspring's generations.",,,unclear,avoidance,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:15:06.937670+00:00
