1189,/san_marshall_207_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,his own parents,kin_role,kinship,Informants state one must not joke with one's parents — a recurrent prohibition.,"They said that just as they must not joke with their own parents or offspring, they must not joke with both a person and that person's offspring.",,,symmetric,avoidance,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:15:25.527787+00:00
