1191,/san_marshall_207_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,an uncle,kin_role,the uncle's wife,kin_role,kinship,"If ego refrains from joking with an uncle, he also refrains with the uncle's wife — status extends to affinal spouse.","In other words, if ego refrains from joking with an uncle, he also refrains from joking with the uncle's wife.",,,unclear,joking_relationship,0.8,Text indicates extension of joking status to spouse; coded as a paired institutional status rather than a one-off.,2026-07-06T10:15:25.527787+00:00
1192,/san_marshall_208_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,A,person,kinship,Text states joking is reciprocal between ego and A; labeled as institutional pattern.,"Joking is reciprocal; if ego jokes with A, A jokes with ego.",,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:15:41.653182+00:00
1193,/san_marshall_208_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,parents' siblings,kin_role,kinship,Informants point out parents' siblings occupy parallel joking positions to parents; recurring kin joking.,"What a !Kung says, when he associates his relatives with each other in the pattern I have called generational, is that they are “like” each other. He considers his parents' siblings to be “like” his parents, ... Instead it was the joking relationship they spoke of, and they pointed out the parallel position of their kin in its terms.",,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:15:41.653182+00:00
1194,/san_marshall_208_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,sibling's offspring,kin_role,kinship,Text states sibling's offspring are 'like' ego's offspring and engaged in the generational joking pattern.,"He considers his parents' siblings to be “like” his parents, his sibling's offspring to be “like” his offspring, his cousins to be “like” himself.",,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:15:41.653182+00:00
1195,/san_marshall_208_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,cousins,kin_role,kinship,Cousins are described as 'like' ego and thus part of the recurrent joking generational pattern.,He considers ... his cousins to be “like” himself.,,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:15:41.653182+00:00
1196,/san_marshall_208_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,ego,kin_role,great-grandparents,kin_role,kinship,Author specifies joking relation established by generational method for ego's great-grandparents lineal kin.,"Only among ego's lineal kin in the generation of great-grandparents, grandparents, grandchildren, great-grandchildren is the joking relation established by the generational method.",,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.85,,2026-07-06T10:15:41.653182+00:00
