1207,/san_marshall_20_1957_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,Ego,kin_role,WiSi,kin_role,kinship,WiSi explicitly listed among affinal joking partners.,"Among affines, ego has the joking relationship with his or her spouse, and also with BrWi and WiSi, tũn m.s., and SiHu and HuBr, tun!ga w.s., who are all considered suitable persons to marry.",,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:16:08.526575+00:00
1208,/san_marshall_20_1957_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,Ego,kin_role,SiHu,kin_role,kinship,SiHu named as an affine with joking status (tun!ga w.s.).,"Among affines, ego has the joking relationship with his or her spouse, and also with BrWi and WiSi, tũn m.s., and SiHu and HuBr, tun!ga w.s., who are all considered suitable persons to marry.",,tun!ga w.s.,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:16:08.526575+00:00
