1345,/san_silberbauer_147_1981_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,Ego,kin_role,his cross-cousins,kin_role,kinship,Text states Ego has a recurring joking relationship with his cross-cousins; clearly kinship-based.,The principles of congruency and of alternating generations are both conditionally negated by the fact that Ego has joking relationships both with his cross-cousins and with their parents.,joking relationships,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T10:25:12.317305+00:00
