1373,/san_silberbauer_318_1972_sv,SouthernAfrica,san,band members,group,his joking partners,group,within_group,"Text describes recurrent, culturally used teasing by band members to correct offenders within the band.","If the expression of a band's decision against him does not mend an offender's ways and he is impenitent in the face of the barbed comments of his joking partners, he will eventually be eased out of the band by means of a public conspiracy to keep him on the wrong foot.",joking partners,,non_symmetric,joking_relationship,0.8,Document frames teasing as an institutional corrective practice by band members toward an offender.,2026-07-06T10:27:55.639609+00:00
