605,/Hausa_Baba_21_NK,WesternAfrica,Hausa,children,kin_role,grandparents,kin_role,kinship,Text explicitly describes recurrent privileged teasing between children and grandparents.,"Joking relationships, expressed by privileged behaviour such as teasing, and the right to appropriate certain possessions of the other party, obtain between children and their grandparents, ... the first-named parties being privileged to tease and take things from the last-named, who retaliate with good-natured abuse and more teasing.",privileged teasing,,non_symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:18:45.756175+00:00
606,/Hausa_Baba_21_NK,WesternAfrica,Hausa,children of a sister,kin_role,children of a brother,kin_role,kinship,Text states an institutionalized joking relation where the first-named children may tease and take things from the others.,"Joking relationships, expressed by privileged behaviour such as teasing, and the right to appropriate certain possessions of the other party, obtain between children and their grandparents, and between children of a sister and a brother, in both cases the first-named parties being privileged to tease and take things from the last-named, who retaliate with good-natured abuse and more teasing.",privileged teasing,,non_symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:18:45.756175+00:00
