676,/Hausa_Smith_44_NK,WesternAfrica,Hausa,occupational groups,group,occupational groups,group,within_group,"Text explicitly describes joking relationships between occupational groups, tied to marriage and cooperation.","Joking relationships between occupational groups were accompanied by preferred marriages between members of the groups, and a strong feeling of zumunta or mutual co-operation. Like all joking relationships, these were expressed annually in the custom of collecting kudin shara.",,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:24:22.960903+00:00
677,/Hausa_Smith_44_NK,WesternAfrica,Hausa,states or racial groups,regional group,states or racial groups,regional group,cross_group,Described as joking ties between states/racial groups that established peace and linkages.,Joking relationships between states or racial groups are said to have been accompanied by a permanent peace; they were regarded as the expression of linkages between such states or groups which stabilised the wider framework within which the Seven Hausa States (“Hausa bakwai”) maintained their existence...,,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:24:22.960903+00:00
678,/Hausa_Smith_44_NK,WesternAfrica,Hausa,owners,group,slaves,group,within_group,Text notes joking relations between owners and their slaves relieving tension and extending kin terms.,"Joking relationships between owners and their slaves served to relieve some of the tension inherent in their relations, as did the extension of kinship terms such as dan uwa to slaves.",,dan uwa,non_symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:24:22.960903+00:00
679,/Hausa_Smith_45_NK,WesternAfrica,Hausa,grandfather,kin_role,granddaughter,kin_role,kinship,Explicit recurrent teasing where grandfather calls granddaughter 'wife'—kinship-based joking role.,"a grandfather may call his granddaughter [unavailable] wife”, while the grandmother may join in and call the little girl “my [unavailable] wife” (kishiarta);",,kishiarta,unclear,joking_relationship,0.9,Text shows grandfather calling granddaughter 'wife' as culturally patterned; directionality not specified.,2026-07-06T09:24:37.903281+00:00
