724,/Kanuri_Cohen_73_NK,WesternAfrica,Kanuri,Ngala's,clan,Magumi,clan,within_group,Text explicitly lists these clans as holding joking relations; classified as within-society clan pairs.,"Joking relations also hold between clans such as Ngala’s and Magumi; Nguma and T[unknown]ara; Kuburi and T[unknown]ara; Su’urti and Kuburi; or between ethnic groups like Shuwa and Kanuri; Kurdi and Shuwa; Hausa and Fulani; Kanuri and Fulani; Tubu and Monga; Monga and B[unknown]adde; Kanembu and Wasili (Arabs). In the above relationships which seem in all cases to cover an area of interrelations involving potential conflicts, the joking takes the form (usually) of the grandparent-grandchild relationship.",,kaka/diwo,non_symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:29:00.892332+00:00
