990,/Tallensi_Fortes_120_NK,WesternAfrica,Tallensi,his wife,kin_role,her sisters,kin_role,kinship,Author names wife's joking relationship with her sisters as a patterned convention.,A man has a joking relationship with his siblings-in-law similar to that of his wife with his sisters and distant clansmen.,joking relationship,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.9,,2026-07-06T09:58:03.800730+00:00
