1006,/Tallensi_Fortes_91_NK,WesternAfrica,Tallensi,Ba'ari,clan,Gorogo,clan,within_group,Text explicitly states Ba'ari has a joking partnership with Gorogo; intra-societal clan tie.,"Each clan among the Talis, and in some cases a particular maximal lineage, has one or more joking partnerships with other clans or lineages. Thus Ba'ari has a joking partnership with Gorogo, Zubiuŋ with Sakpee and Gundaat, Kpata'ar with Wakii, Degal with Samiit, and so forth.",joking partnership,,symmetric,joking_relationship,0.95,,2026-07-06T10:00:16.870891+00:00
